{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":48,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["神掌管未来"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"雅各家，称为以色列名下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从犹大水源出来的，当听我言！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们指着耶和华的名起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提说以色列的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却不凭诚实，不凭公义。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们自称为圣城的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所倚靠的是","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"名为万军之耶和华—以色列的 神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"主说：早先的事，我从古时说明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"已经出了我的口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也是我所指示的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我忽然行做，事便成就。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我素来知道你是顽梗的—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的颈项是铁的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的额是铜的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我从古时将这事给你说明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在未成以先指示你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你说：这些事是我的偶像所行的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我雕刻的偶像和我铸造的偶像所命定的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"你已经听见，现在要看见这一切；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不说明吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从今以后，我将新事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你所不知道的隐密事指示你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这事是现今造的，并非从古就有；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在今日以先，你也未曾听见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你说：这事我早已知道了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你未曾听见，未曾知道；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的耳朵从来未曾开通。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我原知道你行事极其诡诈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你自从出胎以来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便称为悖逆的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"我为我的名暂且忍怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为我的颂赞向你容忍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不将你剪除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我熬炼你，却不像熬炼银子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在苦难的炉中，我拣选你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我为自己的缘故必行这事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我焉能使我的名被亵渎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不将我的荣耀归给假神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华拣选塞鲁士为领导者"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"雅各—我所选召的以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当听我言：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是首先的，也是末后的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我手立了地的根基；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我右手铺张诸天；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我一招呼便都立住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你们都当聚集而听，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们","poem":1},{"noteId":48},{"text":"内中谁说过这些事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华所爱的人必向巴比伦行他所喜悦的事；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的膀臂也要加在迦勒底人身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟有我曾说过，我又选召他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"领他来，他的道路就必亨通。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要就近我来听这话：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我从起头并未曾在隐密处说话；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自从有这事，我就在那里。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在，主耶和华差遣我和他的灵来","poem":1},{"noteId":49},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华对他子民的计划"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"耶和华—你的救赎主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的圣者如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是耶和华—你的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"教训你，使你得益处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"引导你所当行的路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚愿你素来听从我的命令！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的平安就如河水；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的公义就如海浪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的后裔也必多如海沙；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你腹中所生的也必多如沙粒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的名在我面前必不剪除，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不灭绝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"你们要从巴比伦出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从迦勒底人中逃脱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以欢呼的声音传扬说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华救赎了他的仆人雅各！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要将这事宣扬到地极。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华引导他们经过沙漠。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们并不干渴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他为他们使水从磐石而流，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"分裂磐石，水就涌出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恶人必不得平安！","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":48,"caller":"-","text":"或译：偶像","reference":{"chapter":48,"verse":14}},{"noteId":49,"caller":"-","text":"或译：耶和华和他的灵差遣我来","reference":{"chapter":48,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/48.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/49.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/47.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}